{title: Canta Aleluya}
{artist: Linda Strassen}
{key: Am}

{comment: Verso 1}
[Am]Canta [Em]aleluya [Am]al [Em]Señor
(Canta aleluya al Señor)
[Am]Canta [C]aleluya [Esus]al Señor[Em]
(Canta aleluya)
[Am]Canta aleluya[Em], canta [F]aleluya[C]
(A - le - lu - ya)
[Am]Canta [Em]aleluya [F]al [C]Señor

{comment: Verso 2}
[Am]Sing [Em]hallelujah to [Am]the [Em]Lord
(Sing hallelujah to the Lord)
[Am]Sing [C]hallelujah to [Esus]the [Em]Lord
(Sing hallelujah)
[Am]Sing [Em]hallelujah, sing [F]hallelu[C]jah
(Ha - lle - lu - jah)
[Am]Sing [Em]hallelujah [Am]to the [A]Lord
